---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - Made With Pixels, LLC"
  description="Privacy Policy for Made With Pixels, LLC - Our commitment to your privacy"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  updated="2026"
>
  <section>
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      Welcome to Made With Pixels, LLC. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it through our compliance with this policy.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Data Collection</h2>
    <p>
      Made With Pixels, LLC apps are designed with privacy in mind. We do not collect, store, or process any personal information from our users. Our apps operate entirely on your device without requiring any data transmission to external servers.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      Our apps are distributed through official app stores (Google Play Store and Apple App Store). While we don't collect data, these platforms may collect basic analytics and crash reports according to their respective privacy policies. Additionally, our apps may display advertisements from third-party ad networks. These networks may collect and process information about your device and app usage to provide relevant advertisements.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Our apps do not knowingly collect any personal information from children under the age of 13. As we don't collect any user data, parents can be assured that their children's privacy is protected while using our apps.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last updated" date.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:brillianceanimationstudios@gmail.com">brillianceanimationstudios@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
